        <mxCell id="flow-legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF" value="Flow&#xa;1. EKS enqueues agent task on SQS&#xa;2. SQS delivers queued message to Lambda (async)&#xa;3. Lambda invokes Bedrock model inference&#xa;4. Lambda persists conversation to RDS&#xa;5. Lambda stores generated artifact in S3&#xa;6. Lambda reads API credentials from Secrets Manager" vertex="1">
